# Baked knowledge-graph DB (B-56 durable fix) — build artifact, regenerated
# by scripts/build_graph_db.py from the tracked graph_rag/graph.json. Ignored
# locally (never hand-edited/committed by a developer); the
# build-and-deploy-cvce.yml workflow force-adds (`git add -f`) its own fresh
# build as a bot commit, since the live deploy mechanism (Vercel Deploy Hook)
# builds from git HEAD and needs the file to actually be there.
knowledge_engine/graph.db
